4. Prove $ \binom{\lceil 2015/p^k \rceil}{2} \geq \lfloor 2015/p^k \rfloor $ for all $ k \geq 1 $.  
5. Sum $ N_k $ over $ k $ to show $ \sum N_k \geq v_p(2015!) $.  
6. Conclude $ 2015! \mid \det A $ since all prime valuations are satisfied.
