            Solution: Since $z^7 = -1,$ $|z^7| = 1.$  Then $|z|^7 = 1,$ so $|z| = 1.$  Then $z \overline{z} = |z|^2 = 1,$ so $\overline{z} = \frac{1}{z}.$  Hence,
